menu "A2UI core"

    config A2UI_COMPACT_CATALOG
        bool "Compact basic catalog (schemas in flash)"
        default n
        help
            Makes a2ui::basic_catalog::load() load the compact basic catalog
            (Catalog::from_packed). Its JSON schemas stay in flash as
            constant tables and are validated in place, so the catalog takes
            about 15 KB of heap instead of about 220 KB. Validation gives the
            same results.

            Turn this on for chips without PSRAM, such as the ESP32-C3.

            In a compact catalog, ComponentApi::schema, FunctionApi::schema
            and Catalog::source() are undefined; read the schemas through
            schema_node() and source_node(). Code that calls
            Catalog::from_json or Catalog::from_packed directly is not
            affected by this option.

endmenu
